ICU 70 and later (ICU 76 of the package az), as ext/intl of PHP 7.4.33 has
it (php-src 81b3f95622 and 52cda6fc43, Ben Ramsey, PHP 7.4.26; Gentoo carried
both for its PHP 7.3 as php-icu-70.patch until 05.04.2022):
- BreakIterator::operator== returns bool, so the override of PHP 5.6 (UBool)
  does not compile ("conflicting return type"): bool with ICU 70 and later
  (81b3f95622);
- uloc_canonicalize() makes keywords of the extensions of a tag
  (sl_IT_nedis-a-kirti-x-xyz: sl_IT_NEDIS@a=kirti;x=xyz), so
  locale_filter_matches() with canonicalization takes an '@' after the range
  for a separator too (52cda6fc43): without it
  locale_filter_matches('sl_IT_nedis-a-kirti-x-xyz', 'sl_IT_Nedis', true) is
  false.

